  "statement": "The frozen assertion is false. Among connected simple cubic graphs of order below 20, the minimum order of a Type 1 graph with no equitable proper 4-total coloring is 16; there are exactly 16 such isomorphism classes at that least order, with the canonical graph6 codes listed in evidence/disproof.md."
